WEBVTT

00:01:28.356 --> 00:01:31.156
we actually need to learn
from the Vikings.

00:01:31.796 --> 00:01:35.316
But before we get to that,
please indulge me.

00:01:35.316 --> 00:01:37.436
We have to go somewhere else.

00:01:37.476 --> 00:01:38.916
I have to say go back in time.

00:01:38.916 --> 00:01:44.596
Not all the way back to the Viking age
in the heydays of Harald "Bluetooth,"

00:01:44.636 --> 00:01:47.036
but to the 1970s

00:01:47.076 --> 00:01:49.556
during the oil crisis in Denmark.

00:01:50.396 --> 00:01:52.676
Not to a Viking fortress,

00:01:52.716 --> 00:01:57.996
but to a small workshop,
in a barn, in a farm,

00:01:58.036 --> 00:02:00.476
in a village in Denmark.